# Machine-local working area, gitignored and never reviewed. Formatting it
# churns gate logs and recovery scratch files for no reader.
local-tmp/

# The shared plan-structure fixture corpus. Other repositories verify these
# exact bytes by digest, so a reformat here is not cosmetic -- its first
# visible effect is two validators disagreeing for a reason unrelated to either.
specs/fixtures/plan-structure/

